---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | Sora Files" description="Read the terms and conditions for using Sora Files browser-based PDF, image, HEIC, and Word tools." canonicalPath="/terms">
  <Header />
  <main id="main" class="px-5 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="eyebrow text-xs font-semibold text-blue">Terms &amp; Conditions</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-balance text-[clamp(2.25rem,5.5vw,3.5rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.05em]">Simple terms for a simple tool.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-muted">Last updated August 9, 2026</p>
      <div class="mt-12 space-y-10 text-base leading-8 text-muted">
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Using Sora Files</h2><p class="mt-3">You may use Sora Files for lawful file processing. You are responsible for having the right to use the files you select and for reviewing each output before relying on it.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Your files</h2><p class="mt-3">You keep all rights to your files. Current image, HEIC, PDF, ZIP, and DOCX processing happens locally, and Sora Files does not claim ownership of selected files or generated outputs.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Service availability</h2><p class="mt-3">The website is provided as available and may change as browser support improves. File conversion can affect quality, metadata, color profiles, or transparency; the interface explains known trade-offs where relevant.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">No guarantee of suitability</h2><p class="mt-3">Always inspect downloaded files before submitting, publishing, printing, or deleting an original. Sora Files cannot guarantee that every file will reach a requested target or work in every external system.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Changes</h2><p class="mt-3">Material changes to these terms will be reflected here with a revised date.</p></section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
